<title>USA: Interstate General Q1 net falls.</title>
<headline>Interstate General Q1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>ST. CHARLES, Md. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>INTERSTATE GENERAL CO LP</p>
<p>			  Financial Highlights (Unaudited)</p>
<p>					     For the Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						  3/31/97	   3/31/96</p>
<p> Revenues				   $7,387,000    $24,884,000</p>
<p> Expenses				    6,972,000     10,927,000</p>
<p> Net income				    255,000	9,062,000</p>
<p> Net income per Unit			    0.02	     0.87</p>
<p>Weighted average Units outstanding</p>
<p>						10,257,000     10,257,000</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said its 1996 results included $16 million pre-tax income from the sale of four apartment properties in Puerto Rico.</p>
</text>
